# Guide Samim

Samim writes the code and wants to see where each change lands. This PC is Windows. PostgreSQL 18 is already installed locally. `.cursor/install.sh` and `.cursor/start.sh` are Linux cloud-agent scripts. Do not run them here.

Before editing, name the files you will touch and why, in Bangla.

After editing, explain in Bangla. For each file say the path, what changed, and what the user will see. Point at the changed lines. Skip files you did not touch.

```text
MotherPlants.tsx — লিস্টে দাম সেভের বোতাম যোগ হয়েছে।
environment.ts — প্রোডাকশনে ছোট JWT_SECRET এখন সার্ভার আটকায়।
